1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,200
I don't want nobody to get killed

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:22,780
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

3
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,140
So don't take all of the blame where all is spread

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,860
Oh, I don't take all of the blame, you always do

5
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:36,620
There will always be something you cannot control

6
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,880
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:46,720
No sun, no light, such a mess, I love them

8
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:54,860
Don't kill your heart, you make me realize who I need

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,660
I'll be there, hold on, the changes to power

10
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,540
So where are you now?

11
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:07,280
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:10,400
Illusions are born

13
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,920
The golden end is still wrong, but I know it's a pain

14
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,140
That makes us a human after all

15
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:22,140
Toin to save you for the control

16
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:24,040
About your precious worth

17
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,640
This scar may respond to your call

18
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:44,400
Today, we've gathered all nobles with the progenitors' blood to address a growing concern

19
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,280
Humans!

20
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:52,000
The Japanese Imperial Demon Army has been wrapping up operations and increasing their numbers in northern Tokyo

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,500
This human organization is killing our brothers

22
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:56,680
Human organization?

23
00:01:56,680 --> 00:02:00,060
Explaining their territory and flirting with forbidden enchantments to increase their power

24
00:02:00,060 --> 00:02:05,100
According to our intel, they are once again experimenting on the Seraph of the End

25
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:09,720
If we allow these humans to continue to rise and gain strength

26
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:13,520
Another plague like the one that occurred eight years ago will surely come to pass

27
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,580
You needn't worry about that

28
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:21,560
Because we're exterminating the Japanese Imperial Demon Army

29
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:24,880
We're going to war

30
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:29,800
To ensure that we continue to rule this world

31
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:33,740
We'll have to slaughter the greedy livestock resistance once and for all

32
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:38,800
Extermination

33
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,740
The Seraph of the End

34
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,520
Don't worry you

35
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,800
I'm coming to your rescue soon

36
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:52,300
That's all I have to report from block three, sir

37
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:59,440
I'm Imperial Demon Army Major General Shinya Hiragi

38
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:02,900
I'll be covering reports from the Kansai region

39
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:05,900
Several of them concern suspicious vampire activity

40
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,600
Among other things

41
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:11,920
Ichinose

42
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:14,140
Hey, quit sawing logs

43
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,100
Huh?

44
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:21,340
Are we finally done with this boring-ass meeting?

45
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:25,580
Drop the attitude, Gurren

46
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:28,420
You're not as special as you might think

47
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,520
Sorry, General

48
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,840
It's just so hard to remember that

49
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,680
When I'm surrounded by the dullest personalities in the army

50
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,900
Is that so?

51
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:37,660
Well, I can beat the lesson into you

52
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:38,660
Pardon me, sir

53
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:40,940
Ichinose's attitude is nothing new to this room

54
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:43,800
Now, as I was saying

55
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,860
I'm taking it off

56
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:49,420
You can send me all of the information later

57
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:51,120
Come on, Gurren

58
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,060
I can't defend you forever

59
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:55,920
You're gonna have to adjust your attitude sooner or later

60
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,940
Huh?

61
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,200
I never ask you to defend me

62
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:05,160
You Hiragis control the Imperial Demon Army

63
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,520
You don't need a second-class Ichinose hanging around

64
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,320
So, I'm out

65
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,460
I've got some sleep to catch up on

66
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:14,840
At least you know your place, deadweight

67
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,900
We'll handle things like we always have

68
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,420
Without you

69
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:21,600
It's a wonder humanity's still kicking

70
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,760
Later

71
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:40,880
Feels like I lost a few brain cells

72
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:43,400
You can't hide from me today, Gurren!

73
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:50,380
There's no beating around the bush with you

74
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:56,500
It's kind of refreshing after dealing with pointless politics all day

75
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,800
You know what I'm after

76
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:01,440
Now quit wasting my time and give me a cursed gear

77
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,560
I can handle the demon

78
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,900
Oh, yeah?

79
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:06,640
Does this have anything to do with getting vengeance for your family?

80
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:07,420
Of course

81
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:10,120
It's the only thing I've lived for ever since you brought me here

82
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,900
We need to get you a date

83
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:12,740
Soon

84
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:16,740
I better pacify this idiot before he makes a scene

85
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:19,120
Last thing I need is him getting the Hiragi's attention

86
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:23,480
Fine

87
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:26,000
Let's go make a contract with the demon

88
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,080
Then, you'll join us on the front line

89
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:29,720
Huh?

90
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:31,060
No joke?

91
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:32,100
Sure, why not?

92
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:34,100
I don't care if you haven't finished your training

93
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:37,520
That way it's your fault if you die

94
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:40,900
Like we need to worry about that happening

95
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:41,800
I'm a badass

96
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,220
I'll be slaying monsters from dusk till dawn

97
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:47,500
You really are an idiot, huh?

98
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,960
Oh, and there's one more thing, you

99
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,340
Huh?

100
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:55,120
That's for trying to kick a superior officer

101
00:05:55,120 --> 00:06:02,600
The burdens of command can really take it out of you

102
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:06,480
But I've got to admit

103
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:09,120
Things are getting a lot less boring around here

104
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:21,400
What happened to your head?

105
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:24,640
Let me guess, you skipped class and got into another fight?

106
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:26,040
What's it to you?

107
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:29,020
You should know, Gurren doesn't pull any punches by now

108
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:31,540
Um, why'd you ask if you knew?

109
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:32,940
It's fun

110
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:35,520
Congrats, by the way

111
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,660
On the demon contract

112
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:40,020
He finally approved it, didn't he?

113
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,240
Yeah, but you know him

114
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,680
He makes a choice on a whim and doesn't follow through

115
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,900
You can't fool me

116
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,320
I can tell you're nearly bursting at the seams

117
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,780
No, I'm not

118
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:53,920
Don't worry about it

119
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:57,140
Lieutenant Colonel Gurren may have a razor-sharp tongue

120
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,960
And a general fondness for brutality

121
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,640
But he always keeps his promises

122
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,300
Finally

123
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:05,940
It's happening

124
00:07:05,940 --> 00:07:10,600
I'll get the power to kill those parasites

125
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:27,040
The time is near

126
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:30,400
You must be overjoyed

127
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:34,460
It won't be long until you get the chance to see your precious angel again

128
00:07:34,460 --> 00:07:38,540
I have such high hopes for you, Mika

129
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:43,140
It won't be long until you're fast

130
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:43,800
Women are playing

131
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,400
I have such a strong defense

132
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,600
They will play

133
00:07:45,600 --> 00:08:07,160
You may�

134
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:29,160
Come on, hurry!

135
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:44,160
It's all right.

136
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:15,160
All right, pay attention.

137
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:20,160
I've already finished grading your written exams, so I'll just be handing those out and calling it a day, okay?

138
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:25,160
Remember, this score is crucial to your overall cursed gear ranking.

139
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:28,160
The way you perform in class is just as important as in training.

140
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:34,160
I expect those of you with less than passing grades to put extra effort into your studies from now on.

141
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:41,160
Let me see!

142
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,160
Give it back!

143
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:45,160
Oh, wow! Would you look at the score? How impressive!

144
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:47,160
Hey, cut it out!

145
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:53,160
You've really outdone yourself. They say only superhumans can get a score like this!

146
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,160
What being such a pest?

147
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:59,160
Don't you want to share it? You should be so proud!

148
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:01,160
Give that back to me!

149
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:10,160
How'd he get zero points? That takes a special kind of dumb.

150
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:12,160
Whoa, that's crazy!

151
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:15,160
I thought my handwriting sucked, but this guy takes the cake.

152
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:22,160
What's your problem? Can't you find someone else to annoy?

153
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:27,160
Now is that any way to talk to a lady? Especially one who's trying to help you fit in.

154
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:29,160
You could try to show some gratitude.

155
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:32,160
You can take your gratitude and choke on it!

156
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:37,160
I'll tell you what I keep telling Gurren. I don't need friends to stick it to the bloodsuckers. Are we clear?

157
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:44,160
Yeah, we're as clear as crystal. Just don't come crying to me when you realize that you're completely worthless by yourself.

158
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:48,160
Oh, yeah? I'll kill 50 of those fangs with my eyes closed.

159
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:50,160
Said the childish fool.

160
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,160
You're a childish fool!

161
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:54,160
Come on, it makes sense that you failed.

162
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:55,160
Huh?

163
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:57,160
Sorry, that didn't come out like I meant it to.

164
00:10:57,160 --> 00:11:01,160
I'm just saying that since you spent several years as a prisoner of the vampires,

165
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:05,160
your Japanese reading and writing skills aren't as strong as your English and Latin are,

166
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,160
so it makes sense that you failed.

167
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:11,160
Uh, well, yeah, that goes without saying.

168
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:13,160
That excuse is crappier than your test score.

169
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,160
Huh?

170
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,160
How would you know?

171
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:24,160
Then what's your score? It better be epic or I'll pop you in for being an arrogant ass.

172
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:27,160
Come on, Four Eyes, let's see how smart you really are.

173
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:29,160
See for yourself.

174
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:33,160
Latin, English, and Japanese spellcraft. Easy stuff.

175
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:35,160
Foreign languages aren't even my strong suit.

176
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:39,160
I should be no match for a seasoned study abroad poser like you.

177
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:43,160
How about I use you for vamp-killing practice?

178
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:46,160
Yeah, tough guy, come on, let's see you try.

179
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:50,160
You, please stop fighting.

180
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:52,160
Waiter, are you too scared to throw a crutch?

181
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:55,160
Uh, by the way, I still haven't dismissed you from class yet.

182
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,160
Go ahead, open your stupid mouth one more time.

183
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:59,160
I can do the world a favor and end you right here.

184
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:03,160
Hey, I can hear you morons halfway down the hall. What's the deal?

185
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:18,160
Welcome back, Lieutenant Colonel Gurren. I hope everything went well.

186
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:22,160
As well as you'd expect. What else is new?

187
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,160
Oh, come on.

188
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,160
Anyway, is there a reason for all the racket?

189
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,160
Those two.

190
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:30,160
I should have known.

191
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:33,160
Wait, let's put this on hold for now.

192
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,160
Gurren's come out of hiding.

193
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,160
What's the deal?

194
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:39,160
I thought you said I was gonna get to contract with a demon.

195
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:41,160
How much longer do I have to wait-

196
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,160
Let me do the talking.

197
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,160
Way too loud.

198
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:47,160
With all due respect, I think you owe us an explanation.

199
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:53,160
You have an obligation to this class, but you left for over ten days without any regard for your students.

200
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:57,160
I think giving us some cursed gear would make up for that.

201
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,160
Really?

202
00:12:58,160 --> 00:13:03,160
You think a bunch of dumbass losers like you have what it takes to tangle with a demon, huh?

203
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,160
No doubt about it.

204
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:08,160
The only dumbass in here is Kimizuki. I won't fail.

205
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:10,160
Your test score says otherwise.

206
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,160
No one asked for your opinion.

207
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:27,160
So, what's your assessment? Can this class resist the demon's temptation?

208
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:33,160
Hmm. Well, there's always room for improvement, but those two are much stronger than I was at 16.

209
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:35,160
I think they could do it.

210
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,160
What about the others?

211
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:44,160
There are a few contenders, but Yoichi Saotsume takes the cake. He has a surprisingly high stability against demons.

212
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:53,160
Really? Okay then. Why don't we give it a shot now? It's less complicated that way.

213
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:56,160
No! You can't do that in the classroom!

214
00:13:56,160 --> 00:14:00,160
Oh my! Are you planning to attack? This sure got interesting fast.

215
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:02,160
Hope you're ready, kids.

216
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:07,160
If you die from this, blame yourselves for not training hard enough.

217
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,160
Good luck.

218
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:21,160
No!

219
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:29,820
Dude, what the hell is going on?

220
00:14:29,820 --> 00:14:33,500
It feels just like my heart's been squeezed.

221
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:36,100
What's wrong with everyone?

222
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:43,580
I think that's enough for now.

223
00:14:51,160 --> 00:15:02,860
All right, good.

224
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:05,060
If you're still conscious, you've got a chance.

225
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,400
Make no mistake, you've got a long way to go.

226
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:10,060
But if you continue to train and study your spellcraft,

227
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:12,740
you could move into the contract ceremony for a cursed gear.

228
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,900
The five of you that are still on your feet,

229
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:17,000
you've just earned yourself four stars.

230
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:20,380
You'll get to try out for a Black Demon series cursed gear.

231
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:22,460
The same rank of weapon as my sword.

232
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,880
Well, I guess there's only three.

233
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:32,460
You, Kimizuki, and Yoichi.

234
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:37,760
I wish you had passed out.

235
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:42,460
Dealing with demons is like a day at the beach for you, isn't it?

236
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:45,400
Guess I should expect as much from General Haragi's daughter.

237
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:47,260
You probably didn't even use a ward.

238
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:48,680
What a turn-off.

239
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:51,340
Aw, don't be that way.

240
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:54,020
You know I'm the cutest thing you've ever seen in your life.

241
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:54,660
Piss off.

242
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,700
Let's go before I change my mind.

243
00:15:57,700 --> 00:16:09,380
So, uh, Lieutenant Colonel Gurren,

244
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:13,020
I know I should expect unconventional tests and tactics from you,

245
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:18,020
but I'm not entirely sure letting Yoichi try out for the Black Demon series is a good idea.

246
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:20,360
Do you have a problem with my decision?

247
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:23,140
No, sir, that's not what I'm saying.

248
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:27,300
I mean, it's just, I'm not certain he has enough strength to accept a demon and to...

249
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:29,940
Tough. If he doesn't have the strength, he dies.

250
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,660
That's the world we live in.

251
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:33,140
We're not playing games here.

252
00:16:33,140 --> 00:16:42,400
But, sir...

253
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,700
Crying out loud.

254
00:16:44,460 --> 00:16:49,980
Yoichi, tell me, you still want to avenge your sister's death at the hands of the vampires, don't you?

255
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:51,540
Yes, of course.

256
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:53,940
All right.

257
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,840
Are you willing to die for it?

258
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:58,560
I don't know.

259
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:00,740
Then you should quit right now.

260
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,460
If you have any doubts, go back up those stairs.

261
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:06,620
Go, Yoichi.

262
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:11,860
This isn't the kind of place a nice guy like you should be, and you know it.

263
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:29,760
No matter how hard I cover my ears, I still hear it.

264
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:34,440
I'm still under the bed, frightened.

265
00:17:37,140 --> 00:17:38,920
Did you not hear what I said?

266
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:39,720
Get out of here.

267
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,540
I've made up my mind.

268
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:41,920
I'm doing it.

269
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:45,320
This is the only way I'll get the strength I need.

270
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:50,320
I have to make sure that nothing in this world can take away the people I hold dear ever again.

271
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,240
Damn.

272
00:17:53,940 --> 00:17:56,100
In the end, he's no different than I am.

273
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:01,560
Hmm.

274
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:03,660
All right.

275
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:04,940
Let's keep moving, people.

276
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:10,280
Time for the ceremony.

277
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:22,100
Time for the ceremony.

278
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:39,140
Hey, getting cold feet now isn't going to help.

279
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,040
There's no point worrying about it.

280
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,220
Deal with it. You've made your choice.

281
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:49,980
Are you sure you'll be able to deal with it, Kamizuki?

282
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:55,500
You were standing at first. Then you leaned over. Was the demon too much to handle?

283
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:58,440
You saw it too, right, Yoichi?

284
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:01,560
Me? Well... yeah.

285
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:04,560
Stop paying attention to the small things!

286
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,120
They weren't the only ones who saw it, Kamizuki.

287
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:10,880
In fact, I remember you being in a lot of agony.

288
00:19:11,300 --> 00:19:14,180
The last thing you should be doing is getting too comfortable, you.

289
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:18,300
The demon you'll make a contract with is much stronger than the last one.

290
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:22,300
If you let your guard down for an instant, it'll kill you.

291
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,680
Yeah, I already know.

292
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:35,180
Welcome to the edge of hell.

293
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:54,760
Where is this a temple?

294
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:58,580
It's the home of the thing you want most of all.

295
00:19:58,980 --> 00:20:02,520
The highest ranking weapons with demon kings sealed inside them are kept here.

296
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:04,420
The highest ranking, huh?

297
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:12,520
So, if I have one of these, I can kill the vampires?

298
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:15,000
That depends on your personal skill.

299
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:16,400
Okay.

300
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:18,540
But they're all the same as your sword, right?

301
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:20,240
Yes.

302
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:22,800
The rare black demon series.

303
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,240
Quit asking questions.

304
00:20:25,840 --> 00:20:26,640
Let's get started.

305
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:31,400
I've got more important things to do than hang out in a dark cellar with a group of newbies.

306
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:33,020
Fine.

307
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:34,560
What do I have to do?

308
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:37,620
Pick a weapon you like and enter the spell circle.

309
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:41,920
Once you touch the weapon, the contract ceremony will begin automatically.

310
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:46,160
If you don't lose to the demon, you'll gain its power.

311
00:20:47,060 --> 00:20:48,620
And what if we do lose?

312
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:53,840
You'll either become a man-eating monster, or the demon's power will crush your soul and kill you.

313
00:20:55,780 --> 00:20:57,340
Either way, you'll end up dead.

314
00:20:57,720 --> 00:21:00,260
If you start to go monster on us, I'll kill you myself.

315
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:05,380
Fine by me.

316
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:09,160
I've been waiting a long time for a chance like this.

317
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:13,200
Besides, I'd rather fight with the demon than sit through another boring lecture.

318
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,160
The vampires will suffer.

319
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:21,680
For Mika and my family, I'll exterminate every last one of them.

320
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:27,240
That's the only thing I still live for.

321
